note S5 scrub: three nested frames of 2.5 MiB each leave under 1 MiB of the 8 MiB stack pool, so
note SP - 1048576 is below the floor X28: trap 6 (exit 106) before any byte is written.
om2
fn deep d ulong to long
a = new uchar 2621440 0
if lt d 2
ret add deep add d 1 long get a 0
end
k = scrub 1048576
ret add k long get a 0
end
fn main to int
k = deep 0
ret int k
end
